* Readme file
/*
This sample race is for a 3-distance road race: 5K, 10K, and Half Marathon.

All distances share a single start/finish with the following timing events (mats):
GunStart, ChipStart, Announcer, and Finish.

Participants are separated by the RACE field (5K, 10K, or HALF).

Online Integration:
  - RaceRoster is the sole online system for registration and results.
  - SendGrid is used for email notifications (Web API).
  - Twilio is used for SMS notifications.

Key files:
  - @CalcPlaces     — Clears and recalculates places for all 3 distances.
  - @ResultsToRR    — Uploads results to RaceRoster for all 3 distances.
  - @AutoResults    — Combines CalcPlaces + ResultsToRR for one-click publishing.
  - @awards5K/10K/Half — Per-distance awards listings.
  - GunTimePromt5K/10K/Half — Per-distance gun time entry dialogs.

We recommend using the Priority to group your listing files.
You may also use different colors to differentiate the functionality of the different listing files.

All the files follow the best practice recommendation.
*/
